                        ],
                        "form": "die Neophyta"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e9732708-6693-4d87-948c-837cdb6ff2fe",
                        "entry_id": "81a6fe22-c32b-3b07-b859-35c4e9672e3d",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Neophyten"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd97b103-6021-3250-bfdc-17cb35c087b0",
                        "entry_id": "81a6fe22-c32b-3b07-b859-35c4e9672e3d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pflanze, welche nach dem Stichjahr 1492 (Entdeckung Amerikas) durch bewusste oder unbewusste direkte oder indirekte Hilfe des Menschen in Gebiete eingebracht wurde, in denen sie ursprünglich nicht vorkam; eine gebietsfremde Pflanze"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea1ea412-3a77-4826-8186-9fc76d2057ba",
                                "sense_id": "dd97b103-6021-3250-bfdc-17cb35c087b0",
                                "text": "Der Riesenbärenklau, das drüsige Springkraut und die kanadische Goldrute sind invasive Neophyten in Mitteleuropa."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86919420-7c76-4821-90a3-aae7eb39b75a",
                                "sense_id": "dd97b103-6021-3250-bfdc-17cb35c087b0",
                                "text": "„Hier finden sich häufig Neophyten oder Neozoen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab7d3c92-c649-45c1-8103-f977a96e1cc3",
                                "sense_id": "dd97b103-6021-3250-bfdc-17cb35c087b0",
                                "text": "„Ein weit verbreiteter Neophyt unter den Bäumen ist die nordamerikanische Robinie Robinia pseudacacia, die vor rund 400 Jahren nach Europa importiert wurde.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d085d53f-9541-4559-9cce-7b275cf51577",
                                "sense_id": "dd97b103-6021-3250-bfdc-17cb35c087b0",
                                "text": "[Garten:] „Invasive Neophyten, die sich unkontrolliert ausbreiten und einheimische Pflanzen verdrängen, müssen sorgfältig entfernt werden.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b7f8d143-9e20-391e-a5ed-606f69b27421",
                        "entry_id": "81a6fe22-c32b-3b07-b859-35c4e9672e3d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "jemand, der neu im Glauben ist, das ist insbesondere jemand, der kürzlich als Erwachsener getauft wurde, oder neu in einen Orden Aufgenommene (Novizen)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "veraltet; nur Plural 2"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "70298d24-d8e7-433c-a888-1f622fe6f7ba",
                                "sense_id": "b7f8d143-9e20-391e-a5ed-606f69b27421",
                                "text": "„Der Zweite war Serenus, welcher den Feuertod starb, es folgten Heraclides und Heron, welche enthauptet wurden; der Eine von ihnen war noch Katechumene, der Andere Neophyt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ce52257-1121-4961-abe6-b35fa0180b17",
                                "sense_id": "b7f8d143-9e20-391e-a5ed-606f69b27421",
                                "text": "„Wer nun in diesen organischen Verein erst vor kurzer Zeit eingesezt, der Pflanzung Gottes erst kürzlich entsprossen ist, also: wer erst kürzlich zum Glauben gelangt, zur Gemeinde gekommen, ist ein Neophyt.“ (1836)"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d5f773f-0bd4-4b46-a0dc-6a97c999173d",
                        "source_entry_id": "81a6fe22-c32b-3b07-b859-35c4e9672e3d",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd97b103-6021-3250-bfdc-17cb35c087b0",
                        "source_sense_description": "Botanik: eine gebietsfremde Pflanze",
                        "target_lang_word": "neophyte",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "neophyte",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65445511-ffdf-3843-a39c-2257b2155824",
                                        "entry_id": "fa736e07-9ef4-3205-ad25-0407e87a75cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A beginner; a person who is new to a subject, skill, or belief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ee8ae27-afc6-4e7d-a7bb-b71896142a49",
                                                "sense_id": "65445511-ffdf-3843-a39c-2257b2155824",
                                                "text": "A convert's enthusiasm for his new religion is greater than that of a person who is born in it. Vegetarianism was then a new cult in England, and likewise for me, because, as we have seen, I had gone there a convinced meat-eater, and was intellectually converted to vegetarianism later. Full of the neophyte's zeal for vegetarianism, I decided to start a vegetarian club in my locality, Bayswater."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa545c97-23eb-4cd7-b68d-32fa05468351",
                                                "sense_id": "65445511-ffdf-3843-a39c-2257b2155824",
                                                "text": "In this scene Lupita, the neophyte, is counselled by more weathered professionals about the rules and regulations of whoring."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb5226f6-cf5f-4b13-a51c-cd6db7003f53",
                                                "sense_id": "65445511-ffdf-3843-a39c-2257b2155824",
                                                "text": "[…]everyone has to own the floors of whoever you vote for, whether they are a lying handsy narcissistic sociopath[…] or a conspiracy-pandering political neophyte with no clear understanding of how government operates and who once recorded this folk rap about the virtues of bicycling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a538788-7f32-3156-88f8-bf0d2c32f593",
                                        "entry_id": "fa736e07-9ef4-3205-ad25-0407e87a75cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A novice (recent convert); a new convert or proselyte; a new monk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbb8ffee-54f3-4377-ad6c-f48875565a56",
                                                "sense_id": "1a538788-7f32-3156-88f8-bf0d2c32f593",
                                                "text": "The neophyte was given a new name in place of the baptismal one, usually of an evil and revolting character, and this was written in blood in the Devil's book, the covers of which were bound in the skin of unbaptised infants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd0b1c0c-4d04-376b-8e77-99aab2f2b9c1",
                                        "entry_id": "fa736e07-9ef4-3205-ad25-0407e87a75cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Among the early Christians, and still among the Roman Catholics, one who has recently embraced the Christian faith, and been admitted to baptism, especially those converts from heathenism or Judaism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b3ba1b9-3adc-3aa5-a877-c5e553dfeb03",
                                        "entry_id": "fa736e07-9ef4-3205-ad25-0407e87a75cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A plant species recently introduced to an area (in contrast to archaeophyte, a long-established introduced species)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
